Config.Description:
Only used when Database Engine is mysql.

Form: user:password@host:3306/dbname (a full mysql:// DSN also works).
Example: fireside:secret@192.168.1.10:3306/fireside

The database and user must exist first. In the MySQL server run:
  CREATE DATABASE fireside CHARACTER SET utf8mb4;
  CREATE USER 'fireside'@'%' IDENTIFIED BY 'secret';
  GRANT ALL ON fireside.* TO 'fireside'@'%';

Fireside creates its own tables on first start.
